Name: parts
Version: 0.2.0
Date: 2026-10-14
Author: Andreas Bertsatos
Maintainer: Andreas Bertsatos <abertsatos@biol.uoa.gr>
Title: Catalogue of Standard Machine Parts
Description: Standard machine parts in the sizes their makers'
 catalogues list: deep groove ball bearings; socket head cap, low head
 cap, countersunk, raised countersunk, button, pan, cheese, hexagon head,
 shoulder and set screws; hexagon and flange nuts; plain washers;
 retaining rings; heat-set threaded inserts; dowel pins; and parallel
 keys.  Each part is given as data for a calculation and as a solid for
 an assembly, every value cited to the catalogue or standard it comes
 from.  The properties of engineering materials come with them.
Categories: Engineering
Depends: octave (>= 11.1.0), drafting (>= 0.2.2), datatypes (>= 1.5.0)
Url: https://github.com/pr0m1th3as/parts
Tracker: https://github.com/pr0m1th3as/parts/issues
